  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A radioactive nuclide X decays into a nuclide Y. The graph shows the variation with time of the activity A of X. X and Y have the same nucleon number.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is true about nuclide X?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">alpha (α) emitter with a half-life of t</li><li data-label=\"B\">alpha (α) emitter with a half-life of 2t</li><li data-label=\"C\">beta-minus (β<sup>−</sup>) emitter with a half-life of t</li><li data-label=\"D\">beta-minus (β<sup>−</sup>) emitter with a half-life of 2t</li></ol>"
  },
